WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.343
Technical work benefits from reflection because many technical failures are not just technical.

2
00:00:06.343 --> 00:00:11.999
Debugging involves hypotheses, evidence, assumptions, tool choices, and attention.

3
00:00:11.999 --> 00:00:17.120
Code review involves communication, standards, risk judgment, and learning.

4
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:22.852
System design involves tradeoffs, uncertainty, constraints, and future maintenance.

5
00:00:22.852 --> 00:00:30.189
Security analysis involves threat modeling, missed assumptions, and the discipline to test what seems obvious.

6
00:00:30.189 --> 00:00:32.711
Incident response is a strong example.

7
00:00:32.711 --> 00:00:47.079
After an incident or near miss, a team can ask what signals appeared, what was confusing, what decisions helped, what delayed action, what documentation was missing, and what system improvement would reduce risk next time.

8
00:00:47.079 --> 00:00:50.594
The point is not only to identify individual mistakes.

9
00:00:50.594 --> 00:00:54.951
It is to find process, tooling, training, and design improvements.

10
00:00:54.951 --> 00:00:59.689
Operations and troubleshooting also create reflective opportunities.

11
00:00:59.689 --> 00:01:07.867
A recurring alert, a manual recovery step, a difficult handoff, or a fragile deployment can reveal more than one immediate fix.

12
00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:21.089
Reflection asks whether the system is too hard to observe, whether the runbook is incomplete, whether ownership is unclear, or whether a routine task should be automated, simplified, or better monitored.

13
00:01:21.089 --> 00:01:24.299
AI-assisted work adds another reflective layer.

14
00:01:24.299 --> 00:01:32.247
Developers and analysts should review prompts, assumptions, generated outputs, verification steps, and failure modes.

15
00:01:32.247 --> 00:01:33.852
What did the tool do well?

16
00:01:33.852 --> 00:01:34.922
What did it miss?

17
00:01:34.922 --> 00:01:36.833
What checks caught problems?

18
00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:40.960
What prompt or workflow would produce better results next time?

19
00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:46.080
Reflection helps keep AI assistance inside a disciplined human judgment loop.
